# DWNLO: the melodic 808 bass in 303B's old slot (part 3). A normal boot (no debug override),
# select it, play a couple of notes with glide, confirm it renders audibly without clipping,
# and screenshot its one-page SOUND knobs (KNOB 1-4: Tune, Decay, Drive, Glide).
wait 2200
turn ALGO 3
expect part 3
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 400
peakreset
wait 600
expect peak_db_max -0.1
expect peak_db_min -40
tap PLAY
tap EDIT
shot dwnlo_m808_sound.png
